  transaction ids, per-model features
- Solaar (GPL-2.0), libratbag (MIT), Logitech cpg-docs, openlogi.org -
  Logitech HID++ 1.0/2.0 features and receiver pairing
- HeadsetControl (GPL-3.0) - SteelSeries, HyperX and Logitech headset commands
- rivalcfg (WTFPL) - SteelSeries mouse commands
- OpenRGB (GPL-2.0) - SteelSeries Apex, HyperX, ASUS Aura and Corsair lighting
  layouts and device IDs
